## Target Users

### Primary Market

**Geography:** Rhode Island, Southeast Massachusetts, Eastern Connecticut (initial); expandable nationally

**Business Characteristics:**
- Annual revenue: $250K – $5M
- Employees: 1-25
- Monthly marketing budget: $1,500 – $10,000
- Internal marketing staff: 0-1

**Industry Verticals (Priority Order):**

| Tier | Vertical | Why |
|------|----------|-----|
| 1 | Skilled trades (flooring, roofing, HVAC, plumbing, electrical) | High job values, visual work, local SEO gold |
| 2 | Home services (cleaning, landscaping, junk removal) | Volume business, review-dependent, repeat customers |
| 3 | Local professionals (attorneys, accountants, real estate) | Higher sophistication, referral-based, content opportunities |
| 4 | Health & wellness (dentists, chiropractors, med spas) | Recurring revenue, competitive, willing to spend |

### Secondary Market

- Franchisees needing local marketing support
- Startups in service industries
- Established businesses entering new markets

### Anti-Personas (Who This Is NOT For)

- E-commerce businesses (different playbook)
- SaaS companies (B2B tech requires different approach)
- Businesses under $100K revenue (not ready to invest)
- Businesses expecting overnight results
- Those unwilling to participate in their own marketing

