## Risks & Mitigations

### Product Risks

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| Recommendations become outdated | High | High | Quarterly playbook audits, platform update monitoring |
| Generic advice doesn't fit specific situations | Medium | High | Deeper diagnostic questions, more vertical-specific modules |
| Users don't implement recommendations | High | Medium | Better prioritization, simpler first steps, accountability features |
| Competitive AI tools emerge | High | Medium | Focus on local expertise and proven frameworks |
| Claude capabilities change | Low | High | Modular prompt design, platform monitoring |

### Business Risks

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| Market too small (local focus) | Medium | Medium | Expand geographic scope, license to other agencies |
| Cannibalization of services | Low | Medium | Position as entry point to full service |
| Client results vary widely | Medium | Medium | Clear expectation setting, case studies with context |
| Support burden exceeds capacity | Medium | Medium | Self-serve improvements, tiered offering |

